// REJECTS: Unexpected token '.'. Valid alternatives: ['->subType(@', ',', '(']
//
// Nesting in a graph fetch tree is by SUBTREE, never by dotted path. `shapes { area }`, not
// `shapes.area`.
//
// The dotted form is how the same traversal is written everywhere else in Pure -- it is
// exactly what `$this.shapes.area` means in a constraint two sections up -- so a rewrite
// that reuses its expression-level qualified-name parser inside the island accepts it
// immediately. The result is a tree whose root has one child named `shapes.area`, which is
// not a property of anything.
###Pure
function fixture::neg::dottedPath(): meta::pure::metamodel::type::Any[*]
{
   #{
      fixture::neg::Catalog {
         shapes.area
      }
   }#
}
